Cell["Specialise m, g1, g2 and h3,h4 by replacement in the amplitude. The graviton helicities are 2 h3 and 2 h4. Use a fresh kernel for another example because scalar-product assignments persist.", "Text", ExpressionUUID->"42fb288b-7f54-4914-a596-63d6933aa2a0"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
